    "description_raw": "Magic fang gives one natural weapon or unarmed strike of the subject a +1 enhancement bonus on attack and damage rolls. The spell can affect a slam attack, fist, bite, or other natural weapon. The spell does not change an unarmed strike’s damage from nonlethal damage to lethal damage.\n\nMagic fang can be made permanent with a permanency spell.\n\nMagic Fang, Greater\nSchool transmutation; Level druid 3, ranger 3, summoner/unchained summoner 3; Domain scalykind 3; Subdomain cannibalism 3, fist 3",
